-/-- Notation for divergence: `p ↑ inputs` means program `p` diverges on `inputs`. -/
-scoped notation:50 p " ↑ " inputs:51 => Diverges p inputs
-/-- Notation for halting with result: `p ↓ inputs ≫ result` means program `p` halts on `inputs`
