-/-- Elimination of mixed term and type opening. -/
-@[scoped grind .]
-lemma openRecTm_ty_eq (eq : t⟦x ↝ s⟧ᵗᵗ = t⟦x ↝ s⟧ᵗᵗ⟦y ↝ δ⟧ᵗᵞ) : t = t⟦y ↝ δ⟧ᵗᵞ
-  := by induction t generalizing x y <;> grind
